 "notes": "The house reef in front of Hamlet Oasis, entered down the stairs behind Dive Friends; the same reef as the Cliff dive site: a reef plateau to about 9 m, the drop-off, and the vertical Cliff wall from about 9 m to 22 m, with La Machaca at Captain Don's Habitat to the south (divers-guide.com, bonaire.com, dive-centre pages). The route is illustrative. The site's coordinates sit about 130 m inland near Captain Don's Habitat, so the map is centred on the resort's shore. Coastline and dive-site markers © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Positions are approximate.",
